begin="00:12.420" end="00:13.230">my </span><span begin="00:13.230" end="00:14.400">dreams</span><span begin="00:14.400" end="00:15.420">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.420" end="00:22.560"><span begin="00:15.420" end="00:16.890">Forgive </span><span begin="00:16.890" end="00:17.520">me </span><span begin="00:17.520" end="00:17.970">my </span><span begin="00:17.970" end="00:19.200">weakness</span><span begin="00:19.200" end="00:19.230">, </span><span begin="00:19.230" end="00:19.770">but </span><span begin="00:19.770" end="00:20.250">I </span><span begin="00:20.250" end="00:20.910">don't </span><span begin="00:20.910" end="00:21.360">know </span><span begin="00:21.360" end="00:22.530">why</span><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:22.560">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.560" end="00:28.740"><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:23.730">Without </span><span begin="00:23.730" end="00:24.420">you </span><span begin="00:24.420" end="00:24.780">it's </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:25.350">hard </span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.860">to </span><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:28.710">survive</span><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:28.740">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.740" end="00:32.220"><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.070">Cause </span><span begin="00:29.070" end="00:29.370">every </span><span begin="00:29.370" end="00:29.640">time </span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:29.790">we </span><span begin="00:29.790" end="00:30.390">touch</span><span begin="00:30.390" end="00:30.420">, </span><span begin="00:30.420" end="00:30.660">I </span><span begin="00:30.660" end="00:31.110">get </span><span begin="00:31.110" end="00:31.320">this </span><span begin="00:31.320" end="00:32.220">feeling</span><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:32.220">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.220" end="00:35.670"><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:32.430">And </span><span begin="00:32.430" end="00:32.760">every </span><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:33.030">time </span><span begin="00:33.030" end="00:33.150">we </span><span begin="00:33.150" end="00:33.630">kiss </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.780">I </span><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.320">swear </span><span begin="00:34.320" end="00:34.470">I </span><span begin="00:34.470" end="00:34.650">could </span><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:35.640">fly</span><span begin="00:35.640" end="00:35.670">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.670" end="00:39.870"><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:36.030">Can't </span><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.120">you </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.390">feel </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:36.540">my </span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:36.990">heart </span><span begin="00:36.990" end="00:37.380">beat </span><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:37.950">fast</span><span begin="00:37.950" end="00:37.980">, </span><span begin="00:37.980" end="00:38.280">I </span><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.520">want </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.730">this </span><span begin="00:38.730" end="00:38.850">to </span><span begin="00:38.850" end="00:39.660">last</span><span begin="00:39.660" end="00:39.870">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.870" end="00:42.270"><span begin="00:39.870" end="00:40.410">need </span><span begin="00:40.410" end="00:40.560">you </span><span begin="00:40.560" end="00:40.980">by </span><span begin="00:40.980" end="00:41.370">my </span><span begin="00:41.370" end="00:42.240">side</span><span begin="00:42.240" end="00:42.270">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.270" end="00:45.690"><span begin="00:42.270" end="00:42.570">Cause </span><span begin="00:42.570" end="00:42.900">every </span><span begin="00:42.900" end="00:43.170">time </span><span begin="00:43.170" end="00:43.320">we </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.860">touch</span><span begin="00:43.860" end="00:43.890">, </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:44.130">I </span><span begin="00:44.130" end="00:44.640">feel </span><span begin="00:44.640" end="00:44.730">the </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.630">static</span><span begin="00:45.630" end="00:45.690">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.690" end="00:49.200"><span begin="00:45.690" end="00:45.930">And </span><span begin="00:45.930" end="00:46.260">every </span><span begin="00:46.260" end="00:46.560">time </span><span begin="00:46.560" end="00:46.680">we </span><span begin="00:46.680" end="00:47.160">kiss</span><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.160">, </span><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.340">I </span><span begin="00:47.340" end="00:47.760">reach </span><span begin="00:47.760" end="00:48.030">for </span><span begin="00:48.030" end="00:48.120">the </span><span begin="00:48.120" end="00:49.170">sky</span><span begin="00:49.170" end="00:49.200">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.200" end="00:51.540"><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.560">Can't </span><span begin="00:49.560" end="00:49.680">you </span><span begin="00:49.680" end="00:49.920">feel </span><span begin="00:49.920" end="00:50.100">my </span><span begin="00:50.100" end="00:50.520">heart </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.880">beat </span><span begin="00:50.880" end="00:51.510">slow</span><span begin="00:51.510" end="00:51.540">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.540" end="00:53.430"><span begin="00:51.540" end="00:51.780">I </span><span begin="00:51.780" end="00:52.050">can't </span><span begin="00:52.050" end="00:52.290">let </span><span begin="00:52.290" end="00:52.410">you </span><span begin="00:52.410" end="00:53.400">go</span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:53.430">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.430" end="01:38.490"><span begin="00:53.430" end="00:53.970">Want </span><span begin="00:53.970" end="00:54.210">you </span><span begin="00:54.210" end="00:54.540">in </span><span begin="00:54.540" end="00:54.840">my </span><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:56.130">life</span><span begin="00:56.130" end="01:38.490">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.490" end="01:42.090"><span begin="01:38.490" end="01:39.240">Your </span><span begin="01:39.240" end="01:39.870">arms </span><span begin="01:39.870" end="01:40.350">are </span><span begin="01:40.350" end="01:40.770">my </span><span begin="01:40.770" end="01:42.090">castle</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.090" end="01:45.420"><span begin="01:42.090" end="01:42.510">Your </span><span begin="01:42.510" end="01:43.230">heart </span><span begin="01:43.230" end="01:43.710">is </span><span begin="01:43.710" end="01:44.040">my </span><span begin="01:44.040" end="01:45.390">sky</span><span begin="01:45.390" end="01:45.420">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.420" end="01:52.020"><span begin="01:45.420" end="01:45.810">They </span><span begin="01:45.810" end="01:46.650">wipe </span><span begin="01:46.650" end="01:47.520">away </span><span begin="01:47.520" end="01:48.210">tears </span><span begin="01:48.210" end="01:48.960">that </span><span begin="01:48.960" end="01:49.560">I </span><span begin="01:49.560" end="01:51.810">cry</span><span begin="01:51.810" end="01:52.020">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.020" end="01:55.590"><span begin="01:52.020" end="01:52.590">The </span><span begin="01:52.590" end="01:53.280">good </span><span begin="01:53.280" end="01:53.880">and </span><span begin="01:53.880" end="01:54.270">the </span><span begin="01:54.270" end="01:54.900">bad </span><span begin="01:54.900" end="01:55.590">times</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.590" end="01:59.340"><span begin="01:55.590" end="01:56.010">We've </span><span begin="01:56.010" end="01:56.520">been </span><span begin="01:56.520" end="01:57.270">through </span><span begin="01:57.270" end="01:57.780">them </span><span begin="01:57.780" end="01:59.040">all</span><span begin="01:59.040" end="01:59.340">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.340" end="02:05.070"><span begin="01:59.340" end="01:59.970">You </span><span begin="01:59.9